flowchart TD
    CheckNull[CheckNull]
    LogNull[LogNull]
    CheckEmpty[CheckEmpty]
    LogEmpty[LogEmpty]
    CheckActive[CheckActive]
    LogInactive[LogInactive]
    TryProcess[TryProcess]
    WhileFrames[WhileFrames]
    ReturnResult[ReturnResult]
    ExtractFrame[ExtractFrame]
    CheckKeyword[CheckKeyword]
    CheckCooldown[CheckCooldown]
    LogCooldown[LogCooldown]
    LogDetected[LogDetected]
    Start[Start] --> CheckNull{pcmData is null?}

    CheckNull -- Yes  --> LogNull[[Log: Null PCM data]] --> EndFalse[Return false]
    CheckNull -- No  --> CheckEmpty{pcmData is empty?}
    CheckEmpty -- Yes  --> LogEmpty[[Log: Empty PCM data]] --> EndFalse
    CheckEmpty -- No  --> CheckActive{Service active and initialized?}
    CheckActive -- No  --> LogInactive[[Log: Service not active]] --> EndFalse
    CheckActive -- Yes  --> TryProcess[[Try processing audio]]
    TryProcess --> WhileFrames{Buffered frames >= frameLength?}
    WhileFrames -- No  --> ReturnResult[Return wakeWordDetected]
    WhileFrames -- Yes  --> ExtractFrame[[Extract one frame]]
    ExtractFrame --> ProcessFrame[[Process frame]]
    ProcessFrame --> LogOccasional[[Log every 1000 frames]]
    LogOccasional --> CheckKeyword{Keyword detected?}
    CheckKeyword -- No  --> WhileFrames
    CheckKeyword -- Yes  --> CheckCooldown{Within cooldown period?}
    CheckCooldown -- Yes  --> LogCooldown[[Log: Ignored due to cooldown]] --> WhileFrames
    CheckCooldown -- No  --> LogDetected[[Log: Wake word detected]]
    LogDetected --> InvokeEvent[[Invoke WakeWordDetected event]]
    InvokeEvent --> WhileFrames
    TryProcess --> CatchError[[Catch exception]]
    CatchError --> LogError[[Log: Error processing audio]] --> EndFalse